title Vinyl P2a: the output's name on now playing, the Menu's Output row, About's THIS OUTPUT line and the Output page: a long output name (47 characters: it scrolls in the output button and in the Menu row's value, the row's label keeps its width; About wraps it) (the qa sizes and 1280x720)
sizes 800x480 480x480 720x720 480x800 480x640 1280x720
env VINYL_DEMO 1
env VINYL_DEMO_STATE playing
env VINYL_DEMO_BT_NAME "Living room speaker, Bose SoundLink Revolve+ II"

wait 1200
shot 01-now
expect esc
expect text "Living room speaker, Bose SoundLink Revolve+ II"
key m
wait 400
shot 02-menu
expect text "Output"
expect text "Living room speaker, Bose SoundLink Revolve+ II"
tap "About"
wait 400
shot 03-about
expect text "THIS OUTPUT"
key left
wait 400
tap "Output"
wait 400
shot 04-output
expect text "Automatic"
key left
wait 400
expect text "TOOLS"
expect noquit
